@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-05 - View Reviews

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Product UI" as FE
control "ShoesController / ReviewsController" as API
control "ShoesService / ReviewsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, reviews" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-05
FE -> API: GET /reviews/product/:productId
API -> Service: Execute View Reviews
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, reviews
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách reviews hiển thị

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Chưa có review -> hiển thị \"Be the first to review\"
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở trang product detail
Post: Danh sách reviews hiển thị
Main flow:
1. User scroll xuống phần reviews của product detail
2. System gọi API GET /reviews/product/:productId
3. System trả về danh sách reviews (rating, comment, images, user,\ncreatedAt)
4. UI hiển thị star rating trung bình và danh sách reviews
end note
@enduml
